        "flipDefenderLine": "It came in at ten to five on a Friday, in a voice the finance office hears every week. Whoever picked it up had the payment half set up before the message ended. People who fall for calls like this are not stupid: a voice you know is hard to doubt, and this one was built to sound right.",
